OL,3,GNEWSABishop orders review into handling
OL,4,Aof concerns about paedophile priest    
OL,6,FThe Catholic Bishop of Derry has       
OL,7,Fordered an independent external review 
OL,8,Finto how the diocese handled concerns  
OL,9,Fabout the paedophile priest, Fr Edward 
OL,10,FGallagher.                             
OL,12,FGallagher, 59, is due to be sentenced  
OL,13,Fnext month for 109 child sex offences  
OL,14,Fbetween 2023 and 2025 after being      
OL,15,Farrested in Londonderry last year,     
OL,16,Ffollowing a paedophile hunter sting.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
