OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABishop orders review into handling
OL,4,Aof concerns about paedophile priest    
OL,6,FHe admits attempted sexual             
OL,7,Fcommunication with a child under 16,   
OL,8,Fhaving indecent images of children and 
OL,9,Fan extreme pornographic image and      
OL,10,Ftrying to encourage a child to engage  
OL,11,Fin sexual activity.                    
OL,13,FThe review, ordered by Bishop Michael  
OL,14,FRouter, will look at the church's      
OL,15,Fhandling of concerns about Gallagher   
OL,16,Fbeyond those charges and the current   
OL,17,Fcriminal process.                      
